<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!--
    The platform's one server-side field-format engine: the built-in presets, the admin-defined
    "Manage Formats" kinds, email and phone checks. AuthService validates users with it, LeadService
    validates leads with it, and any future service references it instead of copying it.

    Its TypeScript twin is Frontend/packages/ui/src/validation. The two are held together by the shared
    table in Frontend/packages/ui/src/validation/__fixtures__/rule-parity.json, which both test suites
    run: a case that passes on one side and fails on the other breaks a build.

    No dependencies on purpose. Target framework, nullable and implicit usings come from
    Backend/Directory.Build.props.
  -->

</Project>
